-p13-s2","ord":1,"text":"Mina replied, \"We learned that planning and patience make a big difference.\"","translation_ko":"Mina가 대답했다. \"계획과 인내심이 얼마나 큰 차이를 만드는지 배웠어요.\"","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-208-the-class-documentary/audio/p13-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Mina","charStart":0,"charEnd":4,"startMs":0,"endMs":380},{"word":"replied","charStart":5,"charEnd":12,"startMs":380,"endMs":880},{"word":"We","charStart":15,"charEnd":17,"startMs":1280,"endMs":1400},{"word":"learned","charStart":18,"charEnd":25,"startMs":1400,"endMs":1620},{"word":"that","charStart":26,"charEnd":30,"startMs":1620,"endMs":1860},{"word":"planning","charStart":31,"charEnd":39,"startMs":1860,"endMs":2120},{"word":"and","charStart":40,"charEnd":43,"startMs":2120,"endMs":2480},{"word":"patience","charStart":44,"charEnd":52,"startMs":2480,"endMs":2780},{"word":"make","charStart":53,"charEnd":57,"startMs":2780,"endMs":3220},{"word":"a","charStart":58,"charEnd":59,"startMs":3220,"endMs":3420},{"word":"big","charStart":60,"charEnd":63,"startMs":3420,"endMs":3640},{"word":"difference","charStart":64,"charEnd":74,"startMs":3640,"endMs":4060}]},{"id":"daily-208-the-class-documentary-p13-s3","ord":2,"text":"Jun added, \"Next time, I want to make a documentary about our school garden.\"","translation_ko":"Jun이 덧붙였다. \"다음엔 학교 정원에 대한 다큐멘터리를 만들고 싶어요.\"","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-208-the-class-documentary/audio/p13-s3.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Jun","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":400},{"word":"added","charStart":4,"charEnd":9,"startMs":400,"endMs":760},{"word":"Next","charStart":12,"charEnd":16,"startMs":1100,"endMs":1340},{"word":"time","charStart":17,"charEnd":21,"startMs":1340,"endMs":1640},{"word":"I","charStart":23,"charEnd":24,"startMs":1640,"endMs":1840},{"word":"want","charStart":25,"charEnd":29,"startMs":1840,"endMs":2000},{"word":"to","charStart":30,"charEnd":32,"startMs":2000,"endMs":2180},{"word":"make","charStart":33,"charEnd":37,"startMs":2180,"endMs":2200},{"word":"a","charStart":3